    <!--  投影 / 遮罩 / 禁用蒙层 / 禁用前景四把画刷。Status.Disable 在旧库里只有浅色有且写死中性灰，现两主题都补、并取回色相线上  -->
    <SolidColorBrush x:Key="Theme.Brush.Effect.Shadow" Color="{StaticResource Palette.Effect.Shadow}" />
    <SolidColorBrush x:Key="Theme.Brush.Overlay.Backdrop" Color="{StaticResource Palette.Overlay.Backdrop}" />
    <SolidColorBrush x:Key="Theme.Brush.State.DisabledVeil" Color="{StaticResource Palette.State.DisabledVeil}" />
